{"id": "gradient-deep-shrink", "name": "Gradient and scripted Deep Shrink", "family": "patch", "subfamily": "resolution-hack", "plain": "Deep Shrink with a downscale factor that varies through sampling, by a percentage table with optional interpolation, rather than a fixed factor in a window. Other forks add multiple blocks and a fade-out. bleh's variant fades its scale out toward the end of its window.", "math": "Gradient: s = table(percent) with lerp, percent found by a scan of 100 percent_to_sigma values, then interpolate(h, scale_factor=s, bicubic).\nbleh: for block\u2208set, in window; p = 1\u2212t/999; if p\u2265fade: d' = 1\u2212(1\u2212d)\u00b7(1\u2212(p\u2212fade)/(end\u2212fade)); skip if d'\u2265.98.", "props": {"hook": "input_block_patch(_after_skip), output_block_patch", "architectures": "UNet"}, "evidence": [{"where": "kinfolk0117__ComfyUI_GradientDeepShrink/nodes.py:45", "symbol": "interpolate"}, {"where": "kinfolk0117__ComfyUI_GradientDeepShrink/nodes.py:68", "symbol": "config"}, {"where": "kinfolk0117__ComfyUI_GradientDeepShrink/nodes.py:109", "symbol": "sigma_to_scale_factor"}, {"where": "blepping__ComfyUI-bleh/py/nodes/deepShrink.py:181", "symbol": "scaled_scale"}, {"where": "blepping__ComfyUI-bleh/py/nodes/deepShrink.py:219", "symbol": "set_model_input_block_patch_after_skip"}], "providers": [{"pack": "kinfolk0117__ComfyUI_GradientDeepShrink", "author": "kinfolk0117", "licence": "none-found", "kind": "variant", "nodes": ["GradientPatchModelAddDownscale", "GradientPatchModelAddDownscaleAdvanced"], "note": "Default config 0\u2192.5, 1\u21921", "verdict": "SKIP", "risks": [], "res4lyf": false}, {"pack": "blepping__ComfyUI-bleh", "author": "blepping", "licence": "", "kind": "variant", "nodes": ["DeepShrinkBleh"], "note": "Comma block list, fade-out, antialias", "verdict": "", "risks": [], "res4lyf": false, "blepping": true}, {"pack": "portu-sim__comfyui_bmab", "author": "portu-sim", "licence": "AGPL-3.0", "kind": "variant", "nodes": [], "note": "bmab